    /// Given two arrays of signed 8-bit integers of equal length,
    /// return a boolean array of the same length that indicates,
    /// for each position, whether the element of the first array
    /// is greater than or equal to the corresponding element of the
    /// second array.
    ///
    /// Specifications:
    /// 1. The output length equals the input length.
    /// 2. For every index i within bounds, the output at i is true
    ///    iff x1[i] >= x2[i].
    /// 3. If the two input arrays are identical element-wise, then
